# Waiver (documented in docs/security-report.md): AVD-GCP-0015 checks the legacy `require_ssl` argument. This module
# enforces TLS with `ssl_mode = "ENCRYPTED_ONLY"`, the replacement in google provider >= 6 (the old argument is rejected).
AVD-GCP-0015

# Waiver: AVD-GCP-0048 is reported although every node config sets metadata.disable-legacy-endpoints = "true"
